@lang en
IMPORT `tasco-vn19-ch2-cover`

-- Tasco combined health insurance rules, CHƯƠNG V - Quyền và nghĩa vụ của các bên (Chapter V, rights
-- and duties: Articles 14, 15) and CHƯƠNG VI - Giải quyết tranh chấp (Chapter VI, disputes:
-- Articles 16, 17). `src:N` is line N of ../../source/raw/tasco-combined-health.txt.
--
-- Articles 14 and 15 restate, nearly word for word, the catalogues of the Law on Insurance Business
-- (Art 20 at line 445 and Art 21 at line 490 of the aid). Most items carry no condition and no
-- consequence this encoding can compute; those are quoted here and marked inert in NOTES.md. The
-- items with an operative effect are encoded.

§ `Chapter V, rights and duties`

§§ `Article 14, the insurer`

