-- 14.1(c): where the policyholder intentionally gave false information to conclude the contract,
-- Tasco may cancel the contract, refuse payment and claim damages. A permission (MAY), with its
-- trigger as an input.
GIVEN `the policyholder intentionally gave false information to conclude the contract` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 14.1(c), Tasco may cancel the contract and refuse payment` `the policyholder intentionally gave false information to conclude the contract` MEANS
    `the policyholder intentionally gave false information to conclude the contract`

-- src:742 | d. Hủy bỏ Hợp đồng/Giấy chứng nhận bảo hiểm hoặc đơn phương chấm dứt thực hiện
