-- src:762 | f. Nghĩa vụ khác theo quy định của pháp luật.
-- 14.2(b): explain the benefits and the exclusions clearly and fully when the contract is concluded.
-- LAW: Art 19.2 (line 435) requires, beyond that, proof that the policyholder was given the
-- explanation and understood it, for an exclusion to apply. The rules do not repeat the proof
-- requirement; this encoding does not encode the Law (fork F43).

